 !finite_fault factor specification:
DeltaM (0 0 0 0 0 0 0 if a finite-fault factor is not to be used)
 !

 !    If iflag_f_ff = 1: rps = sqrt(r^2 + f_ff^2))
 !    If iflag_f_ff = 2: rps =  r + f_ff
